Subject: [PATCH] scx_cake: snapshot of kernel experiment support

Base: public RitzDaCat/scx commit 8fc5ec9b105198286f7c9f7c53e2bf40308c3a4a.
Source: committed source 6dce0901f151beb6a4d8875b5cf0af3cd9dd5643, scheds/rust/scx_cake/src only.
Exported with git diff --binary --full-index. No working-tree changes included.
Includes native bitops, wake-signal reporting and the intervening scheduler
changes; this is a source snapshot, not an isolated performance experiment.
License: GPL-2.0-only, matching scx_cake.

